 "nodes": [
  {
   "nodeID": "7_168019561412742010",
   "text": "there is no reason to not aim for the highest sustained growth",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "8_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Thangam Debbonaire: Why would we not aim for that",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "10_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Amelie: Thangam Debbonaire: Why would we not aim for that",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "12_168019561412742010",
   "text": "aiming for the highest sustained growth is a mission",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "13_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Thangam Debbonaire: It is a mission",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "15_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Amelie: Thangam Debbonaire: It is a mission",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "17_168019561412742010",
   "text": "a mission is a great thing for a political party to have",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "18_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Thangam Debbonaire: a mission is a great thing for a political party to have",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "20_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Amelie: Thangam Debbonaire: a mission is a great thing for a political party to have",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "22_168019561412742010",
   "text": "we have suffered for too long with a government that has low ambitions, low growth, low productivity",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "23_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Thangam Debbonaire: We have suffered for too long with a government that has low ambitions, low growth, low productivity",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "25_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Amelie: Thangam Debbonaire: We have suffered for too long with a government that has low ambitions, low growth, low productivity",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "27_168019561412742010",
   "text": "we\u2019ve had that stagnating economy for 12 years now",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "28_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Thangam Debbonaire: We\u2019ve had that stagnating economy for 12 years now",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "30_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Amelie: Thangam Debbonaire: We\u2019ve had that stagnating economy for 12 years now",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "32_168019561412742010",
   "text": "when Thangam Debbonaire first came into parliament in 2015 the first debate she took part in was a debate about low productivity",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "33_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Thangam Debbonaire: When I first came into parliament in 2015 the first debate I took part in was a debate about low productivity",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "35_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Amelie: Thangam Debbonaire: When I first came into parliament in 2015 the first debate I took part in was a debate about low productivity",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "37_168019561412742010",
   "text": "nothing has changed",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "38_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Thangam Debbonaire: nothing has changed",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "40_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Amelie: Thangam Debbonaire: nothing has changed",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "42_168019561412742010",
   "text": "we might have had the same growth rate as we\u2019d had at the last Labour government every single one of us",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "43_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Thangam Debbonaire: If we had the same growth rate as we\u2019d had at the last Labour government every single one of us",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "45_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Amelie: Thangam Debbonaire: If we had the same growth rate as we\u2019d had at the last Labour government every single one of us",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "47_168019561412742010",
   "text": "every income would be around about \u00a310,000 better off",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "48_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Thangam Debbonaire: every income would be 10,000\u2026around about \u00a310,000 better off",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "50_168019561412742010",
   "text": "Amelie: Thangam Debbonaire: every income would be 10,000\u2026around about \u00a310,000 better off",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
